<title>NETHERLANDS: HAL TRUST EXPECTS 1996 PROFIT OF $102 MLN.</title>
<headline>HAL TRUST EXPECTS 1996 PROFIT OF $102 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investment group HAL Trust said on Monday it expected to report a 1996 profit of some $102 million.  </p>
<p>In 1995 HAL made a net profit of $96 million.</p>
<p>HAL said earnings per share were about $1.60 in 1996 versus $1.51 in 1995 and said it would pay a 1996 dividend of $0.80 per share, up from $0.70 in 1995.</p>
<p>It said the value of its assets rose by some $340 million to around $1.2 billion at the end of 1996.</p>
<p>HAL said it would publish full 1996 results on March 27. </p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
